                <a id="corresp-c1" aria-label="email Stéphane Pesce" href="mailto:stephane.pesce@inrae.fr">Stéphane Pesce</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Ethics declarations"><div class="c-article-section" id="ethics-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="ethics">Ethics declarations</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="ethics-content">
              
              
